4. The flash memory can be put in power-down and its clock can be gated off when executing from SRAM.
5. Theoretical value based on V DD  = 3.3 V, DC/DC Efficiency of 85%, V CORE  = 1.10 V
6. Theoretical value based on V DD  = 3.3 V, DC/DC Efficiency of 85%, V CORE  = 1.05 V
