| Fast-mode (up to 400 kbit/s)                                | X      | X      | X      |
| Fast-mode Plus with 20mA output drive I/Os (up to 1 Mbit/s) | X      | X      | X      |
| Programmable analog and digital noise filters               | X      | X      | X      |
