5. The I/O analog switch voltage booster is enable when V DDA  &lt; 2.4 V (BOOSTEN = 1 in the SYSCFG\_CFGR1 when VDDA  &lt; 2.4 V). It is disable when V DDA ≥ 2.4 V. No oversampling.

