2. Cparasitic  represents the capacitance of the PCB (dependent on soldering and PCB layout quality) plus the pad capacitance (refer to Table 70: I/O static characteristics ). A high C parasitic  value will downgrade conversion accuracy. To remedy this, f ADC  should be reduced.
