4. Refer to Figure 21: Power supply scheme .

## General PCB design guidelines

Power supply decoupling should be performed as shown in Figure 21: Power supply scheme . The 10 nF capacitor should be ceramic (good quality) and it should be placed as close as possible to the chip.

